ption {\n inputStream.close();\n }\n\n @Override\n public synchronized void mark(int readlimit) {\n inputStream.mark(readlimit);\n }\n\n @Override\n public synchronized void reset() throws IOException {\n inputStream.reset();\n }\n\n @Override\n public boolean markSupported() {\n return inputStream.markSupported();\n }\n}"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"Now I need to create the MockServletInputStream helper class that's referenced in the test:
